OL,3,GNEWSA'Children as young as 12 smoking
OL,4,Acannabis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren as young as 12 years old are
OL,7,Fsmoking cannabis outside Telford
OL,8,Fschools, a council meeting has heard.
OL,10,FIt seemed to be "common around the
OL,11,Fplace" to smoke cannabis and vape
OL,12,Foutside of schools and that it was
OL,13,F"almost accepted," Councillor Paul
OL,14,FThomas told a heath and wellbeing board
OL,15,Fmeeting.
OL,17,F"My perception everywhere I go is there
OL,18,Fis an increasing number of children `
OL,19,Fand I mean children, probably 12 years
OL,20,Fof age maybe even younger, vaping,"
OL,21,FThomas said.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
