OL,3,GNEWSA'Children as young as 12 smoking
OL,4,Acannabis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTelford and Wrekin Council's director
OL,7,Fof public health confirmed the issue of
OL,8,Fcannabis use was being picked up by
OL,9,Fschool nurses and has been raised at
OL,10,Frecent health meetings.
